# Allowlist, not a blocklist.
#
# This working folder holds a lot that should never be published: PRD
# spreadsheets, screenshots, UI kits, scratch test notes. Rather than
# enumerate those and risk missing one, ignore everything at the root and
# then explicitly un-ignore only what is meant to be public.
#
# To publish something new, add an "!" line for it. Nothing else ships.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/MEASUREMENT.md
!/TESTING.md
!/data/
!/policies/

# Re-ignore these even inside the allowlisted folders above.
.DS_Store
*.env
.env.*
!/MEASUREMENT.md
!/TESTING.md
